# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# NeXT UIG ch3 in the desktop shell: Cmd-Space completes in the Find
# window's name field and in the save panel's.
wait 10
key f ctrl
wait 5
key D
key o
key c
key space ctrl
wait 3
expect-find-text Documents
key Escape
wait 3
note the save panel completes against the folder it shows
key f ctrl
wait 5
key z
wait 2
click 642 405
wait 6
key a ctrl
key BackSpace
key r
key e
key c
key space ctrl
wait 3
key Return
wait 6
expect-alert already
quit
